OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and scattered
OL,6,Fshowers moving northwards as the day
OL,7,Fprogresses, some heavy with hail and
OL,8,Fthunder leading to the risk of
OL,9,Fflooding in places. Scotland remaining
OL,10,Flargely dry. Feeling warm and humid in
OL,11,Fthe sunshine, with light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers easing this evening,
OL,14,Fthough some making their way into
OL,15,Fsouthern Scotland. Further
OL,16,Fthunderstorms and torrential rain
OL,17,Fmoving back into southern and central
OL,18,Fareas overnight. Turning murky in the
OL,19,Fnorth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
