OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FBands of heavy rain and
OL,6,Fthunderstorms slowly moving northwards
OL,7,Facross England and Wales, sunnier
OL,8,Fskies following from the southeast.
OL,9,FBright spells for Scotland and
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland, with scattered
OL,11,Fshowers. Warm.
